  "history": [
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "The Ancient Radiants",
          "revealedIn": [
            { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "53" },
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "53" },
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "83" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The book Words of Radiance calls the Elsecallers prodigiously benevolent, and names them the prime liaisons with the great ones of the spren.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "53" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "They were appointed keepers of the perfect gems, and took on the protection of the ruby called Honor's Drop.",
          "revealedIn": [
            {
              "all": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "53" },
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "83" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": [
        {
          "text": "The True Desolation",
          "revealedIn": [
            { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "33" },
            { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "119" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jasnah tells Shallan she survived by Elsecalling into Shadesmar, but getting back took a long time.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "33" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jasnah is the only Elsecaller of her time: no new inkspren other than her own will risk a bond.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "119" }]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Ideals of the Elsecallers",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The Ideals of the Knights Radiant, also called the Immortal Words, are rules the Radiants live by. The First Ideal is shared by every order; each order then has four more of its own.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }]
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "The First Ideal",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Elsecallers share the First Ideal with every other order; it serves as the motto of the Knights Radiant.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }]
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "text": "Life before death, strength before weakness, journey before destination.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "59" }],
              "spokenBy": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Abilities",
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elsecallers use the Surges of Transformation and Transportation.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Among the orders that visited the realm of spren, the Elsecallers were generous, bringing others along on their visits.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "53" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have an uncommon affinity with the beads of Shadesmar.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "53" }]
        }
      ],
      "parts": [
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Transformation",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" },
                { "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "33" },
                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "39" }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Transformation, or Soulcasting, can change an object into one of the Ten Essences.",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "words-of-radiance", "chapter": "prologue" }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Soulcasting can turn one material into another, though turning it into one of the Ten Essences is easiest.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "way-of-kings", "chapter": "33" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "To Soulcast, an Elsecaller shifts their perception into the Cognitive Realm and speaks with the object's Cognitive aspect. Elsecallers see Soulcasting differently from Lightweavers.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "39" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Transportation",
              "revealedIn": [
                { "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "33" },
                { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "53" },
                { "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "50" }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Elsecalling, a use of Transportation, lets them travel bodily into Shadesmar, though getting back out is much harder.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "oathbringer", "chapter": "33" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "It works by opening a small perpendicularity, an Elsegate, for the Elsecaller to pass through. The Surge is very hard to master.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "53" }]
            },
            {
              "text": "An Elsecaller can also pass through the Spiritual Realm, moving themselves or others seemingly faster than light.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "50" }]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": [
            {
              "text": "Enlightened",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "31" }]
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "An Elsecaller whose inkspren has been Enlightened by Sja-anat can still use Transportation as usual.",
              "revealedIn": [{ "book": "wind-and-truth", "chapter": "31" }]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
